        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "What makes up the whole?",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Put the whole first, then its components, then the composition verb. The listed parts constitute the whole; this is not an affected-object passive.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这个小组由三位老师组成。",
                "pinyin": "zhège xiǎozǔ yóu sān wèi lǎoshī zǔchéng 。",
                "meaning": "This group consists of three teachers.",
